; To enable the features listed above do the following:
;
;  1.   Connect the DebugCable with the serial number C12090164581
;       to your Lauterbach module.
;       Note: You can't use the Debug Interface LA-7701.
;
;  2.   Start the TRACE32 software.
;
;  3.   Run this script file with the command
;       DO y12090164581.cmm
;
;  4.   Restart TRACE32
;
; Please do not forget to stick the new label on the DebugCable.
